# THE ROOT — what a viff instance looks like, by top-level path.
#
# This is the one part of the schema that no Go type declares. Every other definition is the
# wire shape of a struct somewhere (generated) or a correction to one (curated.tony); this one
# says what the surface IS: the top-level paths, and the shape served at each.
#
# It is HAND-WRITTEN, and that is the trade. It used to be derived from viffd's route table,
# which made it unable to lie and also made the whole schema unobtainable without a server —
# you could not read what a viff instance looks like without running one. Now the schema stands alone
# and the API is what has to agree with it, which is a test (TestTheRootIsTheServedSurface)
# rather than a construction.
#
# A key is a BARE top-level path — entities, not flow/tree or tasks/{id}/events. One level
# down belongs to the route table at GET /api, which is the complete surface; this is the root.
#
# What is missing, and why:
#
#   watch   — a stream of server-sent events, not a document. The frames carry viff-event, but
#             the WIRE form of the stream is not described yet; that is worth adding, and this
#             is where it goes when it is.
#   schema  — this document's own shape, which is likewise not a named type.
#   charter — the installed charter, addressed like the viff instance itself and answering the same
#             shape at every node (writes/reads/triggers/strata/children). It is a document
#             this server BUILDS rather than a struct's wire form, so there is no generated
#             type to point at; it belongs here the day one exists. `viff-trigger` and
#             `viff-stratum` still describe what is INSIDE it, and GET /charter/{name}
#             answers one of them.
#
# The control plane is absent by construction: POST /flow/suspend is something you DO to a viff instance,
# not part of what one looks like.
context:
- tony-format/context
define:
  accounts: .[array(viff-account)]
  asks: .[array(viff-ask-row)]
  api: .[viff-routes]
  entity: .[viff-entity]
  groups: .[array(viff-group-row)]
  healthz: .[viff-health]
  iods: .[array(viff-iod-row)]
  outboxes: .[array(viff-outbox)]
  perms: .[viff-perms-record]
  resolvers: .[array(viff-resolver-row)]
  runners: .[array(viff-runner-row)]
  flows: .[array(viff-flow-row)]
  schedules: .[array(viff-schedule-row)]
  tasks: .[array(viff-instance)]
  state: .[viff-state]
  status: .[viff-status]
  whoami: .[viff-whoami]

signature:
  name: root
